AP1 Precision NA: approximately 330 hp estimated from the authored torque curve, 9,200 rpm native limiter, six-speed H-pattern manual, mechanical LSD and S2000-sized Hina's Drifters tyres. Native mass, wheelbase, suspension hardpoints and animation handwheel range are retained. Special Edition Suzuka Blue is the initial HDC visual preset, with the native front splitter, hard top and decklid spoiler selected. Native colour, rim and optional-part customization remain available.
